.TH PHX 1 "2026-09-05" "Phalanx Duel" "Phalanx Duel Local Tooling"
.SH NAME
phx \- unified Phalanx Duel control plane
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/phx
.RI [ guide | capabilities | ctx ]
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B phx
dispatches the repository's agent and human control-plane commands.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B guide
Show the agent documentation index.
.TP
.B capabilities
Show capability vectors.
.TP
.B ctx
Extract context for a task.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show usage and exit successfully.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phx-demo (1),
.BR phx-services (1),
.BR phx-dock (1)
